[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_jh3xa")
text = "[b]Digital Parade Float Ideas[/b] 
 
 Yo y'all! I'm Xrayo44 of the c/freecloudcity moderator team.  
 
 As you all know, we are participating in the digital parades this next Saturday, and we asked you guys to come up with suggestions for what I should put on our float. Here are some cool ideas: 
 
 1. To represent their home in the neighborhood of Morwell, The_Adriana_Maisy suggested that the parade include her favorite animal, the extinct polar bear. 
 
 2. Another great suggestion that I took a personal liking to was from Geelonglover2011, who suggested we add the cloud effect that surrounds and follows the float. 
 
 3. The last suggestion is that of a shirtless man dancing some popular Cloud City breakdance moves. This suggestion was, of course, from OfficialCloudCityBreakDanceClub. 
 
 Thank you all for the suggestions. "
